{ "type": "Feature", "properties": { "id": null, "Naam": "Hoge Woerd", "Info": "Vanaf 1999 heeft het grootschalige onderzoek in het kader van Leidsche Rijn de wereld buiten het fort op de kaart gezet. Langs de uitvalswegen ontwikkelde zich een kampdorp (vicus), waar handelaren, ambachtslieden, kroegbazen en soldatengezinnen een bestaan bij elkaar scharrelden. Aan de zuidkant was deze ‘winkelstraat’ op zijn hoogtepunt 250 meter lang.", "Type": "Vicus" }, "geometry": { "type": "MultiPolygon", "coordinates": [ [ [ [ 131172.640971440938301, 455161.034341604623478 ], [ 131172.496144324541092, 455166.24811679776758 ], [ 131173.654761007288471, 455171.461891998245846 ], [ 131176.696129838615889, 455177.834283919830341 ], [ 131182.054732094751671, 455183.482540415425319 ], [ 131199.409985659935046, 455199.160396660270635 ], [ 131220.790049618401099, 455223.238090963102877 ], [ 131234.057486665609758, 455248.216887807415333 ], [ 131244.268364011571975, 455284.144049551978242 ], [ 131249.56289293608279, 455315.91122412547702 ], [ 131251.565790204738732, 455339.828526146768127 ], [ 131252.234824096376542, 455358.427671067940537 ], [ 131253.305278399959207, 455373.681646051758435 ], [ 131256.516641452617478, 455392.548404582892545 ], [ 131337.335947602521628, 455366.188465810671914 ], [ 131341.617765138740651, 455366.322272627265193 ], [ 131346.56861665751785, 455367.927954230341129 ], [ 131350.716627379297279, 455371.13931740418775 ], [ 131353.794183716294356, 455374.484487368143164 ], [ 131354.597024493094068, 455376.625396143121179 ], [ 131373.731396304588998, 455434.563739776960574 ], [ 131390.591052597534144, 455483.40322112897411 ], [ 131391.527700161008397, 455487.685038669558708 ], [ 131391.393893343862146, 455491.29782221710775 ], [ 131390.858666132611688, 455494.910605757671874 ], [ 131389.520598140807124, 455497.051514516584575 ], [ 131388.048723353509558, 455498.791002882469911 ], [ 131382.562644620047649, 455501.467138817533851 ], [ 131300.539077310531866, 455523.5